# valgrind.supp -- suppressions for scripts/valgrind-smoke.sh.
#
# Rules:
#  * Only noise from GLib, fontconfig, Pango, FreeType, the dynamic loader and
#    the Mesa/driver stack is suppressed, and each entry says why.
#  * No entry may name a libydk frame.  If a libydk bug shows up it is a
#    real failure.  A suppression whose stack starts below libydk but passes
#    through libydk is not allowed either: match the library frames only.
#  * Prefer "fun:" patterns that name the third party function that reads
#    the data, not a broad obj:* wildcard.
#
# Start empty on purpose.  Add an entry only after reading the stack and
# checking that the report is in the third party code itself.
